  "html": "  <section class=\"wrap thanks\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Lifetime confirmed</p>\n      <h1 class=\"lh grad\"><span class=\"l\">Thank you for</span> <span class=\"h\">backing us.</span></h1>\n      <p>Your Lumalook Lifetime is paid for: every look and every pack, now and in future. A receipt from Polar, our reseller, is on its way to your inbox.</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li>Keep the receipt. Your Lifetime is tied to <b>the email you paid with</b>.</li>\n        <li>On launch day we email you the App Store link.</li>\n        <li>In the app, open <b>You</b>, then <b>Restore web purchase</b>, and enter that email. We send a one-time code and Lifetime switches on.</li>\n      </ol>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-y\" href=\"/\">Back to Lumalook</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n",
